### Scene Description in RDF Triples (Turtle Format)

```turtle
@prefix ex: <http://example.org/scene#> .
@prefix rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .

ex:EgoVehicle rdf:type ex:Vehicle ;
    ex:following ex:LeadVehicle ;
    ex:approaching ex:HayBale .

ex:LeadVehicle rdf:type ex:Vehicle ;
    ex:near ex:HayBale .

ex:HayBale rdf:type ex:Obstacle ;
    ex:locatedOn ex:Roadway .

ex:Environment rdf:type ex:WeatherCondition ;
    ex:hasType "HeavyRain" ;
    ex:hasVisibility "Low" ;
    ex:hasRoadSurface "Wet" .

ex:TrafficLight rdf:type ex:Infrastructure ;
    ex:state "Red" .
```

